      "notes": [
        {
          "en": "Frame annotations count repeated observations of an object; unique_instances counts distinct official instance_token values.",
          "zh": "逐帧标注数会重复计算同一物体；独立实例数按官方 instance_token 去重。"
        },
        {
          "en": "The 23 occupancy candidates involve 74 distinct source objects: 45 barriers, 26 traffic cones and 3 debris objects. They are a subset of the 154 objects in the scene.",
          "zh": "23 个占用候选涉及 74 个不同原始物体：45 个路障、26 个锥桶、3 个杂物。它们是全场景 154 个物体的子集。"
        },
        {
          "en": "ROAD_OCCUPANCY and LANE_MARKING_GEOMETRY are candidate event types, not object semantic classes. An overlap does not by itself confirm a lane closure or an HD-map geometry error.",
          "zh": "ROAD_OCCUPANCY 和 LANE_MARKING_GEOMETRY 是候选事件类型，不是物体语义类别。几何重叠本身不能直接证明封路或高精地图几何错误。"
        },
        {
          "en": "A barrier category identifies the object. Current road state and a proposed structural map edit are separate downstream decisions.",
          "zh": "路障类别说明物体是什么；当前道路状态与是否提出地图结构修改，是后续两个不同的判断。"
        },
        {
          "en": "nuScenes object tracks reuse official instance identities. Motion and vehicle behavior states are derived with thresholds; they are not independent detector or learned behavior-model predictions.",
          "zh": "nuScenes 物体轨迹复用官方实例身份。运动与车辆行为状态由阈值规则派生，不是独立检测器或学习型行为模型的预测。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Lane geometry candidates use learned YOLOP masks followed by geometric fitting and map comparison; their presence does not establish perception accuracy or a confirmed map defect.",
          "zh": "车道线几何候选使用学习型 YOLOP 掩码，再进行几何拟合和地图对比；存在这些候选并不等于已验证感知准确率或已确认地图缺陷。"
        }
      ],
